# Task acceptance evidence

Close every task with:

- the ledger task ID, or "no ledger ID"
- the files changed
- the criteria met and the criteria still blocked
- the commands or UI path actually run, and the observed result
- the rollback path
- the next dependency

Use ledger status words only for recorded facts. Written code is not Verified. An open pull request is not Released.

When a browser check was done, name the route and what was visible. When it was not done, say so.

`explain-every-change.mdc` and `record-work-for-ledger.mdc` still apply.
